Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,《死神来了5》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:49.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,早安 各位员工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Presage employees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:53.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们准备好参加令人兴奋的团队建设培训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hope you're all ready for our exciting team-building retraining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:54.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,请享用您的早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please enjoy your breakfast..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:57.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们上车 很快就会出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then make your way to the bus, which will leave shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:00.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我说 "你能为培训准备一些早餐吗?"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sam, I said, "Would you put breakfast together for the retraining?"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:03.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是弄些甜麦圈 还有咖啡 之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant, like, some stale doughnuts, some coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:09.17,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 兄弟 别忘了我上个月的销售报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, man. Just remember that when you see my sales report for last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我昨晚看见到了 - 该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I saw it last night. - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.07,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼斯看了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has Dennis seen it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.52,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是需要做个决定 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you just need to make a decision, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:19.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以做厨师 或是做业务员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna be "chef" or you gonna be "sales guy".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:24.84,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,作为朋友 我才这么说 如是你的老板 我早开除你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying that as your friend because, as your boss, I'm ready to fire your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:27.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 作为朋友 我很感激这个建议 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As your friend, I appreciate that advice. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:32.52,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我宝宝的房里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside my baby's room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:33.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我马上就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, man, I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:37.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我做的不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess I'm doing okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.53,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我走进…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I moved in with..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:45.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,茉莉 你的车票被取消了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Molly. Your ticket's canceled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:46.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我这只是一个误会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me that's a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:48.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我原想过完这个周末告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna tell you after this weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:49.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 告诉我什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, tell me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:53.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这不是 一个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I don't think it's such a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:57.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 旅行吗? 这是我兄弟的婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, the trip? it's my brother's wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:05:00.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:01.95,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该晚点再谈论这件事 我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should talk about this later. Let's just..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:06.31,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 接下来的两天我都假装没看到这个? 就现在说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, pretend like I didn't see this for the next two days? No, let's talk about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有结果的 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working out, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:12.49,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会有结果的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not working out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:18.07,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.47,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 你是坎蒂丝 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's, uh, Candice, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:22.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一点都不好笑 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not funny. - Oh..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:27.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 这次不是度假 是一次商务培训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sorry, this is not a vacation. Okay, this is a business retraining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们接下来的两天 面对的都将是公事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're gonna be all business for the next two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:34.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 不过这不能改变你还是一个实习生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, but doesn't change the fact that you're still an intern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:41.85,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,唔 今晚十二点三十分宵禁 你要准备好出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, um, but that 12:30 curfew tonight. You should plan on breaking that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:42.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,为何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:46.44,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们"袒胸"团队合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the naked team-building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,奥莉维亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Olivia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.07,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:09.58,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我会记住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. I keep trying to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:12.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 我喜欢它 有点莉萨乐步的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hmm. - I like it. it's very Lisa Loeb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:14.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, you know..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:18.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢做自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather be very Olivia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们周日要办一个音乐会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a gig on Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.64,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我一定会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:25.16,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,早 彼特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:27.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看起来精神不错 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looking good. - Uh, hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:30.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,奥莉维亚 你和城里每个时髦的人都睡了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olivia. Have you slept with every hipster in town yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,坎蒂丝 你应该为这次实习买单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candice. Do you actually get paid for this internship..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:35.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,还是你老爸多给你零用钱了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or does Daddy just increase your allowance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:40.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想摆脱婴儿肥 你应该去健身房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you wanna get rid of that baby fat, you should try the gym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:43.35,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的设备有些落后 不过你依然可以使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have these workout machines that you use on your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:43.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对你有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're good at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:45.95,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 这不是胖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetie, it's not fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:49.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他们称之为爆乳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're called tits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:55.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来不太好? 茉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not looking so hot there, Moll-face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:56.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.83,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你尝了你男朋友做的果酱面包吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you try the little jam-bread whatever your boyfriend made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:03.40,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你 他真的… 怎么了? 我碰到了神经?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta tell you, he's a pre.. Uh-oh, that's what it is, is it? Did I touch a nerve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:07.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我安静下 艾萨克 - 摩尔 摩尔 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just leave me alone, Isaac. - Hey, Moll? Moll? Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想找人聊聊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever need anyone to talk to..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我是很好的倾听者… 嘘 等下 别说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been told I'm a good listener by a lot of ladies. Shh, wait. Don't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:14.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你是上星期二的津博吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me this is Kimber from last Tuesday.{\r}
