Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我记得你 你是一个大女孩 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I remember you. You were, like, a bigger gal, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该做什么吗? 你应该道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you should do? You should apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.03,0:07:25.44,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么 - 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,别介意 就说"对不起 因为我…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never matters. "I'm sorry, because I.."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,斯坦 你怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Stan, how's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 我叫山姆 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it's Sam, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:43.94,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你在纠正我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just correct me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.52,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.41,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我叫什么名字 - 丹尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's my name? - Dennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:50.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,别看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:52.02,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,都准备好了吗 彼特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All set, Pete?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:54.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 先生 我在等内森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Yeah, we're just waiting on Nathan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:57.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事是无法循环的 彼特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the one thing we can't recycle, Pete?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:58.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,浪费时间 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasted time, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:02.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我想在90秒之内出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. I wanna be on the road in 90 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:05.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚看见他的车了 我去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well, I just saw his car, so I'll go track him down.{\r}
