Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.58,1:06:05.49,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们 我觉得我们是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not us, we're supposed to be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼斯 我们有更大麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Dennis, we got bigger problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.16,1:06:11.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,奥莉维亚和艾萨克死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olivia and Isaac are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.98,1:06:12.70,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是艾萨克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Isaac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.71,1:06:15.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,艾萨克帕默 技术员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isaac Palmer, tech support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.43,1:06:18.29,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不是已经死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't he dead already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.30,1:06:19.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 丹尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Dennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.89,1:06:25.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说… 我们也会和他们一样的 除非我们做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, it's going to happen to us too if we don't do something about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.42,1:06:29.30,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你的意思 听着 这被称为"幸存者内疚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I understand. Listen, it's called survivor's guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.31,1:06:33.41,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的 内疚并不会死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, guilt doesn't kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.57,1:06:35.54,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 你没有遇到我的岳父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, you've never met my in-laws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.35,1:06:37.94,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是开玩笑 丹尼斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not fucking around here, Dennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:39.54,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,任何人可能是下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone could be next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.37,1:06:42.48,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有可能是你! 听懂了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be you. Understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.49,1:06:43.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.76,1:06:46.45,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.47,1:06:50.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,吊桥倒塌 我们本不应该活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We weren't supposed to survive that bridge collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.08,1:06:54.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,现在只有杀人或者被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so now it's kill or be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.84,1:06:56.41,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗 丹尼斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get that, Dennis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.15,1:06:58.79,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,随便了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.80,1:07:01.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告你了 随便你想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you. Do whatever you wanna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.93,1:07:07.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.50,1:07:14.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 布洛克警官 是我 丹尼斯 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Agent Block, it's Dennis. Um..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.16,1:07:19.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,彼特 到我这里来过 完全失控了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Pete just came in here and he's just completely lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.23,1:07:21.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,嚷着一会说谋杀 一会说被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's yelling about "kill or be killed."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.14,1:07:24.40,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 听起来像是个威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, it definitely sounded like a threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.13,1:07:42.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.72,1:07:45.64,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 不知道 发生得太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't know. It just happened so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.50,1:07:49.33,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 内森 你还好吗? - 我还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nathan. Are you okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.51,1:07:52.54,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当我听到时我在想… - 不 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We heard, and we thought.. - No. No, uh, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.12,1:07:55.10,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.11,1:07:56.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.40,1:07:59.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I just..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.71,1:08:02.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是个巧合 他正好在那…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just timing, you know? He got in the way and..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.81,1:08:03.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你杀了他 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you did, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.66,1:08:06.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你预见了 你杀了他 你让他代替你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw it coming, and then you took his life. You put him in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.11,1:08:09.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的什么也没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't really do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.52,1:08:13.03,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说实话 你做了还是没做? - 彼特 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell ture, Did you or didn't you? - Hey, Peter, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.27,1:08:14.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了还是没做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you or didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.70,1:08:18.08,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了还是没做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you or didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.69,1:08:22.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我想我做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I think I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.93,1:08:24.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.63,1:08:29.05,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,假如理论成立 你找个替死鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if the theory works, then you traded spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.10,1:08:32.47,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他替你死了 你得到了生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should have your death, and you should have his years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.52,1:08:34.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么能够肯定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know for sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.01,1:08:37.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得有个死亡顺序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's an order to these deaths.{\r}
