Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.01,1:08:57.58,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼斯! 是丹尼斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dennis! It was Dennis.{\r}
