Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.59,1:09:02.34,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.32,1:09:07.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,为何要和我争论?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you fighting me on this?{\r}
