Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.15,1:09:17.53,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果死神来找我 无论我在哪里都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Death is gonna come for me, I don't think it matters where I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.53,1:09:19.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须做些什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.01,1:09:21.50,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杀了他人来救自己? - 不 当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, kill someone so I can live? - No, of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.75,1:09:25.55,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在想其他的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll just have to figure something else out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.74,1:09:27.69,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经想出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have figured it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.70,1:09:30.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情把我从桥上救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something saved me on that bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.38,1:09:33.05,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他根本没想让我死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it doesn't want me to die.{\r}
