Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.11,1:09:39.52,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,茉莉 我们不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't live our lives in fear, Moll.{\r}
