Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.87,1:11:33.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,文森 快点 好不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vincent, speed it up, okay?{\r}
