Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.86,1:22:22.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着 我得到布洛克的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does that mean I get Block's life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.46,1:22:27.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
