Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.89,1:22:38.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,(两周之后)
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.30,1:22:48.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以坐在窗户旁边吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I take the window seat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.52,1:22:50.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想让我坐在中间? - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you kidding me? You're gonna make me sit in the middle? - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.39,1:22:54.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你开玩笑吗? 我的比你大两倍 - 不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm like twice your size. - Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.35,1:22:55.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.67,1:22:58.02,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要杀了他 - 妈的 我要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll remove him. - Fuck you. I'll remove..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.18,1:22:59.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.55,1:23:00.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,镇定下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Settle down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.43,1:23:03.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点 要爆炸了 快 你个笨蛋 - 快下飞机!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Browning! Come on, you punk! - Get off the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.02,1:23:06.49,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,快下飞机 你们不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off the plane. You don't understand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.64,1:23:08.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,大家请坐好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody just stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.33,1:23:14.38,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那里怎么了? - 我也不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's all that about? - I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.13,1:23:18.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们 我们即将开始…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, we'll be pulling away from the gate as..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.13,1:23:25.40,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要起飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.50,1:23:27.61,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,起飞时客舱光线会调暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cabin lights have been dimmed for takeoff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.69,1:24:00.16,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 风中灰尘 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Dust in the wind ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.03,1:24:14.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.50,1:24:18.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.31,1:24:24.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,之前下飞机的乘客 是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those passengers who got off the plane earlier, what was that all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.23,1:24:27.02,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一个孩子恐慌症发作了 想离开飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A kid had a panic attack and wanted off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.06,1:24:28.85,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他看到了幻象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he had some kind of vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.58,1:24:30.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.05,1:24:34.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.03,1:24:40.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
