Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.52,1:25:14.44,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 山姆! - 茉莉 抓紧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam! - Molly, hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.88,1:25:18.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.11,1:25:20.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.50,1:25:47.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你来 内森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice of you to come, Nathan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.55,1:25:49.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道罗伊不是很容易共事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Roy wasn't the easiest guy to work with.{\r}
