Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.81,1:25:56.51,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是 不开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, no kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.27,1:25:58.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这结果更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it was for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.01,1:26:01.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.20,1:26:04.21,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,为了保险的原因 他们做了尸检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Company did an autopsy for insurance purposes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.35,1:26:07.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,查出来罗伊的脑血管扩大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out Roy had an enlarged blood vessel in his brain so big..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.66,1:26:11.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,产生的血管破裂 他们说他们随时会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was about to burst. They said he'd be dead any day now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.69,1:26:14.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,随时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.00,1:26:16.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这他妈就是生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's a bitch.{\r}
